{% flag country="eu" /%} Happy Europe Day! {% flag country="eu" /%}

On 9 May we celebrated what makes Europe unique: cooperation across borders, shared values, and the belief that no one should be left behind in the digital transition. For us at AI-ASSISTANTS 4PID, that belief sits at the heart of the project.

AI-ASSISTANTS 4PID brings together eight organisations from six countries to make sure people with intellectual disabilities are not left out of the AI revolution — but actively shape it. Through tailored AI literacy training, adapted resources and stronger support for professionals and families, the project turns artificial intelligence into a real tool for independent living. Eight partners. Six countries. One shared goal: a more inclusive, digitally fair Europe.

Thank you to our consortium:

🔹 [**Institute Work and Technology | Westphalian University of Applied Sciences**](https://de.linkedin.com/company/institut-arbeit-und-technik?trk=public_post-text) (Germany) — coordinator

🔹 [**AIAS Bologna ETS**](https://it.linkedin.com/company/aias-bologna?trk=public_post-text) (Italy)

🔹 [**CECD**](https://pt.linkedin.com/company/cecd1976?trk=public_post-text) (Portugal)

🔹 [**INESC-ID Lisboa**](https://pt.linkedin.com/in/inesc-id-lisboa-6281a028?trk=public_post-text) (Portugal)

🔹 [**Universitat Politècnica de València (UPV)**](https://es.linkedin.com/school/upv/?trk=public_post-text)(Spain)

🔹 [**Amica**](https://es.linkedin.com/company/asociacionamica?trk=public_post-text) (Spain)

🔹 [**ARFIE Network**](https://be.linkedin.com/company/arfienetwork?trk=public_post-text) (Belgium)

🔹 @HURT (Croatia)

A more inclusive Europe is a digitally fair Europe. Let's keep building it — together.

🔗 Discover the project: [**https://ai4pid.eu**](https://ai4pid.eu/)

